<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index fell one point to 1,283.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index fell one point to 1,283.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates rose to 1,283 today from 1,284 on May 19, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p> Route Index     Rate   Prev Index  Rate</p>
<p>   1    1350    12.257	  1352    12.279</p>
<p>   1a   1297  9821.000	  1302  9864.000</p>
<p>   2    1529    21.843	  1527    21.821</p>
